7e8d1d76-f65f-4b2c-be0f-147fc4f85e79-0
00:16:03.320 --> 00:16:08.994
So I want to start by talking about
predatory financing and disguised control,

7e8d1d76-f65f-4b2c-be0f-147fc4f85e79-1
00:16:08.994 --> 00:16:13.520
which is an area where we provided
