7ce2934e-e414-4e44-957d-417add312b12-0
00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:17.576
And I'm really grateful for the
department prioritizing this and,

7ce2934e-e414-4e44-957d-417add312b12-1
00:16:17.576 --> 00:16:21.487
and willing being willing to consider
recommendations that we've made to

7ce2934e-e414-4e44-957d-417add312b12-2
00:16:21.487 --> 00:16:22.880
improve these protections.

8d501cce-4444-44e6-aee2-6c8fab0e0a52-0
00:16:23.160 --> 00:16:27.306
You know, as a state,
we have a really long history of economic

8d501cce-4444-44e6-aee2-6c8fab0e0a52-1
00:16:27.306 --> 00:16:29.120
exploitation and extraction.

2b2739df-cc72-4e68-8aa7-37738db3d4b5-0
00:16:29.120 --> 00:16:33.783
And I think we all have a shared interest
in making sure that this not become

2b2739df-cc72-4e68-8aa7-37738db3d4b5-1
00:16:33.783 --> 00:16:38.386
another place where outside money and
interest come in and take advantage of

2b2739df-cc72-4e68-8aa7-37738db3d4b5-2
00:16:38.386 --> 00:16:40.120
our people and our resources.

1cf2033e-b841-4d9b-8983-9fe67d9efdff-0
00:16:41.240 --> 00:16:44.960
I want to say that the amendments don't
fully address this problem.

e7621509-566b-4dd2-b4a1-06da3d2ff9ed-0
00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:48.453
And even with the changes to actual
control,

e7621509-566b-4dd2-b4a1-06da3d2ff9ed-1
00:16:48.453 --> 00:16:53.678
the regulations continue to still to
broadly restrict ownership arrangements

e7621509-566b-4dd2-b4a1-06da3d2ff9ed-2
00:16:53.678 --> 00:16:59.039
and risk unintentionally prohibiting
things that are beneficial and legitimate

e7621509-566b-4dd2-b4a1-06da3d2ff9ed-3
00:16:59.039 --> 00:17:04.196
non predatory financing arrangements,
while at the same time not protecting

e7621509-566b-4dd2-b4a1-06da3d2ff9ed-4
00:17:04.196 --> 00:17:09.285
enough to prohibit more sophisticated
arrangements of disguised control or

e7621509-566b-4dd2-b4a1-06da3d2ff9ed-5
00:17:09.285 --> 00:17:12.000
other deceitful and predatory practices.

43a39cee-c53a-48b2-9998-fdecb6187e15-0
00:17:13.440 --> 00:17:18.586
Under the current draft regulations and
under these proposed amendments,

43a39cee-c53a-48b2-9998-fdecb6187e15-1
00:17:18.586 --> 00:17:22.393
it is still unclear whether a party could,
and if so,

43a39cee-c53a-48b2-9998-fdecb6187e15-2
00:17:22.393 --> 00:17:27.540
how they can invest in a permittee
without taking responsibility for the

43a39cee-c53a-48b2-9998-fdecb6187e15-3
00:17:27.540 --> 00:17:30.360
compliance and actions of the permittee.

2fb70d6d-aad3-401f-bec3-cdb57cfc5e0f-0
00:17:31.320 --> 00:17:37.407
And that given the lack of traditional
investment vehicles that are available in

2fb70d6d-aad3-401f-bec3-cdb57cfc5e0f-1
00:17:37.407 --> 00:17:41.390
this space, right,
involving a Schedule 1 substance,

2fb70d6d-aad3-401f-bec3-cdb57cfc5e0f-2
00:17:41.390 --> 00:17:47.252
we don't have traditional financing and
banks that lack of clarity would lock

2fb70d6d-aad3-401f-bec3-cdb57cfc5e0f-3
00:17:47.252 --> 00:17:52.813
away needed capital like even friends and
family investments out of local

2fb70d6d-aad3-401f-bec3-cdb57cfc5e0f-4
00:17:52.813 --> 00:17:53.640
operations.

031c9e41-8f2a-4021-a628-830fa2aeab9a-0
00:17:54.440 --> 00:17:59.073
We hope that there's an opportunity to
continue to iterate on and improve these

031c9e41-8f2a-4021-a628-830fa2aeab9a-1
00:17:59.073 --> 00:18:03.360
critical and foundational protections
further in the rule making process.

3991d458-74a9-41fb-8cda-7c6b0fc936d6-0
00:18:03.960 --> 00:18:09.154
Really we believe that the solution is
not to restrict investment broadly,

3991d458-74a9-41fb-8cda-7c6b0fc936d6-1
00:18:09.154 --> 00:18:14.349
but to instead distinguish clearly
between those who are exercising actual

3991d458-74a9-41fb-8cda-7c6b0fc936d6-2
00:18:14.349 --> 00:18:19.336
control over a permitted business and
those who are hold a more passive

3991d458-74a9-41fb-8cda-7c6b0fc936d6-3
00:18:19.336 --> 00:18:19.960
interest.

3d62144a-e336-41f4-b091-b871296cf194-0
00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:25.434
And so we've offered some suggestions
that reframe around around these

3d62144a-e336-41f4-b091-b871296cf194-1
00:18:25.434 --> 00:18:31.141
distinctions in order to strengthen
protections for permittees in the program

3d62144a-e336-41f4-b091-b871296cf194-2
00:18:31.141 --> 00:18:36.921
from bad actors while preserving access
to what is very limited capital in the

3d62144a-e336-41f4-b091-b871296cf194-3
00:18:36.921 --> 00:18:37.360
field.

