Mexico is the first state to allow for

00045fc9-9df8-4fdc-aa39-7874ff2955e4-1
00:18:51.798 --> 00:18:55.080
non property owners to operate within the
cannabis industry.

5614672e-2e46-425f-86ae-8e8cf15b3675-0
00:18:55.080 --> 00:19:00.153
And that was a tremendous step in equity
and access in the cannabis space and

5614672e-2e46-425f-86ae-8e8cf15b3675-1
00:19:00.153 --> 00:19:03.080
changed dramatically the national
landscape.

9cea1bde-d5ce-4baf-a2ca-2d8a0e7c5025-0
00:19:03.840 --> 00:19:06.800
And I'm really proud to live in a state
that that modelled that.

4106cde6-86ce-4231-839c-f79e9df32f5f-0
00:19:07.320 --> 00:19:09.917
We also know that it created very new
