80f80910-6659-4264-bd9f-cc09665c8a98-0
00:39:31.480 --> 00:39:36.717
If the goal of the program is to keep
cost to as low as they can be to Section

80f80910-6659-4264-bd9f-cc09665c8a98-1
00:39:36.717 --> 00:39:41.160
2 Ade liability should be really
minimized to the extent possible.

f9d2553c-e484-4a2b-b1e7-ec081d7ea2bd-0
00:39:42.360 --> 00:39:46.253
For folks who aren't familiar with
Section 2 AE it,

f9d2553c-e484-4a2b-b1e7-ec081d7ea2bd-1
00:39:46.253 --> 00:39:52.243
it's a it's a tax rule that requires that
any organization or individual who is

f9d2553c-e484-4a2b-b1e7-ec081d7ea2bd-2
00:39:52.243 --> 00:39:58.233
trafficking in a Schedule one or Schedule
2 substance must pay taxes and is not

f9d2553c-e484-4a2b-b1e7-ec081d7ea2bd-3
00:39:58.233 --> 00:40:04.223
able to deduct the standard deductions
and expenses that they incur in the cost

f9d2553c-e484-4a2b-b1e7-ec081d7ea2bd-4
00:40:04.223 --> 00:40:06.320
of operating their business.

9b83e21e-ccfe-432f-affb-0053a69a36cb-0
00:40:07.200 --> 00:40:12.952
So with respect to how to minimize that
tax liability in the state of Oregon in

9b83e21e-ccfe-432f-affb-0053a69a36cb-1
00:40:12.952 --> 00:40:17.553
its psilocybin program,
the common practice is for operators to

9b83e21e-ccfe-432f-affb-0053a69a36cb-2
00:40:17.553 --> 00:40:23.306
bifurcate their liability so that those
asked portions of their operations that

9b83e21e-ccfe-432f-affb-0053a69a36cb-3
00:40:23.306 --> 00:40:28.195
are plant touching or or mushroom
touching that would be engaged in

9b83e21e-ccfe-432f-affb-0053a69a36cb-4
00:40:28.195 --> 00:40:33.875
trafficking activities are maintained
separately from the other aspects of the

9b83e21e-ccfe-432f-affb-0053a69a36cb-5
00:40:33.875 --> 00:40:36.680
operations that are not plant touching.

3bb60c2e-a35f-4454-9ec1-7ee2e530519e-0
00:40:37.280 --> 00:40:41.882
So that all of that liability can be sort
of isolated and and contained within as

3bb60c2e-a35f-4454-9ec1-7ee2e530519e-1
00:40:41.882 --> 00:40:44.520
small a portion of the operations as
possible.

c81251be-4be3-4c6a-a34c-6f35de0cbf14-0
00:40:45.880 --> 00:40:49.800
This kind of structuring that is pretty
common.

07c126cc-8aa3-4513-86c2-ac8970756f88-0
00:40:49.800 --> 00:40:53.045
Not everybody structures their
organizations that way,

07c126cc-8aa3-4513-86c2-ac8970756f88-1
00:40:53.045 --> 00:40:57.884
but but many do and it does substantially
reduce the amount of tax liability that

07c126cc-8aa3-4513-86c2-ac8970756f88-2
00:40:57.884 --> 00:40:59.359
those organizations have.

42b45425-2e9c-4a78-a010-39d19cd4b15d-0
00:40:59.960 --> 00:41:05.646
But there is an opportunity to go further
than that and that would be through

42b45425-2e9c-4a78-a010-39d19cd4b15d-1
00:41:05.646 --> 00:41:10.240
